            },
            "method": "OPTIONS",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/set/consulta-ruc",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "set",
                "consulta-ruc"
              ]
            },
            "description": "`Set_Options` atiende `OPTIONS /api/set/{*any}` con `AuthorizationLevel.Anonymous`. Va **sin auth a proposito**: si necesitara la key, ningun navegador podria completar el preflight."
          }
